1139 0 obj
  << /ActualText (PROFESSIONAL EXPERIENCE\n\nUX\057UI Designer \023 WOOO Social Games\054 Inc\056\050Key Biscayne\054 FL \050USA\051 \057 Barcelona \050Spain\051 \024 Remote \174 2023\0232025\n\nDesigned and improved user interfaces and interactive flows for mobile and web gaming products\054 focusing on usability\054 engagement and visual coherence\056\050\nWorked closely with product managers\054 developers and stakeholders to translate user needs and business goals into clear design solutions\056\050\nContributed to the development of a scalable design system to ensure consistency and smoother handoff to development teams\056\050\nCollaborated with other designers by sharing workflows\054 prototypes and best practices to align design quality across projects\056\050\nSenior Graphic Designer \023 Pongomilogo\050Barcelona\054 Spain \174 2017\0232022\n\nDesigned brand identities\054 packaging\054 and marketing campaigns\056\050\nCollaborated directly with clients and marketing teams to deliver strategic creative solutions\056\050\nArt Director \023 Eureka Media\050Reggio Emilia\054 Italy \174 2013\0232017\n\nDirected creative strategy and visual direction for regional and international campaigns across corporate\054 cultural and exhibition sectors\056\n\nLed and mentored a small design team\054 coordinating designers\054 photographers and copywriters to ensure cohesive project delivery\056\050\nManaged client relationships\054 from concept presentations to final approval\054 translating business and brand objectives into impactful visual solutions\056\050\nDesigned and curated visual identity\054 layouts and digital\057print materials for major international ceramics exhibitions\054 enhancing brand visibility and audience engagement\056\n\nEnsured consistency across all touchpoints\024branding\054 editorial\054 events and digital media\024while balancing creativity\054 budgets and deadlines\056\050\nFinancial Services \046 Client Experience Specialist\240 \023 Citi Bank\050Barcelona\054 Spain \174 2008\0232013\n\nPromoted and sold financial products\054 achieving high customer satisfaction and sales targets\056\050\nManaged back\055office operations\054 documentation\054 and compliance with banking procedures\056\050\nCollected customer insights and collaborated with internal teams to improve service efficiency and user communication\056\n\nGraphic Designer \057 Senior Graphic Designer \024 Eureka Media\050 Reggio Emilia\054 Italy \174 2004\0232008\n\nDesigned visual identities\054 packaging and advertising for commercial and cultural organizations\056\050\nDeveloped integrated marketing campaigns\054 aligning design\054 storytelling and market positioning\056\050\nCollaborated with photographers\054 copywriters and magazine editors to create visual content for advertising and editorial publications\056)
